bottled-openclaw
================

This repository packages OpenClaw for Cloud in a Bottle / OpenHost.

OpenClaw
--------
This image is built FROM the official OpenClaw container image and distributes
OpenClaw, a self-hosted personal AI assistant / multi-channel gateway.

  Upstream:    https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw
  License:     MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 OpenClaw Foundation
  Base image:  ghcr.io/openclaw/openclaw, pinned by digest in the Dockerfile
               (tag 2026.7.1). Third-party components bundled in OpenClaw are
               listed in the upstream THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

OpenClaw is distributed under the MIT License; its copyright notice and the MIT
permission notice are reproduced in LICENSE, as MIT requires for
redistribution. OpenClaw's source is not modified by this package; the
container entrypoint binds its data directory to persistent storage, fetches
the Anthropic API key from the Cloud in a Bottle secrets service, and writes an
OpenClaw config that trusts the Cloud in a Bottle router's owner header for
authentication and sets the default model.

